 "provenance": "Bavaria 8 (world 1, level 7, menu 8) normal exit 49,22 from spawn, control-only, on the corrected harness (logic + paint each frame). Start values: weaponTier 2 (hook from the Bavaria 3 chest; Bavaria 4+ start with it), maxHealth 4 (no armor), lives 12 (campaign-plausible, as in the other Bavaria routes), diamonds 0 and redDiamonds 0 (the magic lock counts this stage's diamonds), diving false (the DIVING ITEM is obtained in this stage). Route: riddle room 0 (trigger 12,11): both snakes hooked out of their pits and crushed with the two pushed stones; DIVING ITEM chest 20,12 opened and its item dialogue dismissed with the action key (ticks 641-686); 33+8+6 ticks to step up to 20,11 and realign the remaining controls by 44 ticks with the stage timers. Grass 7,17 trampled to drain the pool, three floating diamonds, spike field timed to checkpoint 2 (19,22); six diamonds, stone 25,23 hooked aside; grass 29,16 trampled so the pool water floats stone 31,23; spike corridor timed; five column diamonds; checkpoint 3 (43,16). Riddle room 1 (trigger 45,9): both snakes hooked into column 48 and crushed by the hooked stone 49,7; 30-diamond chest 51,8; full-health chest 42,9 gives 10 diamonds; spikes timed; checkpoint 4 (36,6). Stone 15,2 hooked to fall onto the mine stack 17,5: the chain explosion clears the rubble; 40-diamond chest 10,6 (94 diamonds, magic lock 70 satisfied). Grass 31,8, 35,11 and 41,13 trampled so the top basin water flows into column 44-45 and floats stone 45,21; back via checkpoint 4, spikes timed, down column 44, grass 46,21 trampled, magic lock 48,22 opened, exit 49,22. No damage, no deaths. Rebuilt from the prepaint certified route (attempts/prepaint-1-bavaria-08-normal.json): first 663 ticks kept, controls from its tick 689 on replayed 44 ticks later.",
